		<outline text="Decoder: Ad-Free Edition" type="rss" title="Decoder: Ad-Free Edition" description="This is the ad-free version of Decoder, exclusively for Verge subscribers. Subscribe now for full access.&#xA;&#xA;Decoder is a show from The Verge about big ideas — and other problems. Verge editor-in-chief Nilay Patel talks to a diverse cast of innovators and policymakers at the frontiers of business and technology to reveal how they’re navigating an ever-changing landscape, what keeps them up at night, and what it all means for our shared future." htmlUrl="https://theverge.com" xmlUrl="https://verge.supportingcast.fm/content/eyJ0IjoicCIsImMiOiIyMDc1MCIsInUiOiIyNjExNjE1IiwiZCI6IjE3NTk5NjE0NDMiLCJrIjoxMDQ5MX18YWZkNWRkZmRhYzJkMmNkOGM5OTY0MWUyYWZhYzg0MWU5OGFiYTQ1NTRhNzZhOTQxZTA5OTdiZGFjMzFhZTA4NQ.rss?t=1769283331241"></outline>
		<outline text="The Vergecast: Ad-Free Edition" type="rss" title="The Vergecast: Ad-Free Edition" description="This is the ad-free version of The Vergecast, exclusively for Verge subscribers. Subscribe now for full access. &#xA;&#xA;The Vergecast is the flagship podcast from The Verge about small gadgets, Big Tech, and everything in between. Every Friday, hosts Nilay Patel and David Pierce hang out and make sense of the week’s most important technology news. And every Tuesday, David leads a selection of The Verge’s expert staffers in an exploration of how gadgets and software affect our lives — and which ones you should bring into yours." htmlUrl="https://www.theverge.com/the-vergecast" xmlUrl="https://verge.supportingcast.fm/content/eyJ0IjoicCIsImMiOiIyMDc0OSIsInUiOiIyNjExNjE1IiwiZCI6IjE3NTk5NjEzODQiLCJrIjoxMDQ5MX18NDljYmIzZDFmYTYxMGIwZmI1MTY4NTVhZjZhYTk5NmY5MzZmMTIyOTAyZjRlNzlkNTI1NDM1ZmI4MjNkYjZiYQ.rss"></outline>
